infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Circular import: which form survives the half-built module
  desc Both modules enter sys.modules before their bodies run — one form demands the name too early
  compares
    - label import a
      children
        - label Binds the module object
          desc Takes half-built a from sys.modules; demands no attribute yet
        - label Attribute access deferred
          desc a.helper() resolves at call time, not during import
        - label By call time a is complete
          desc The module body has finished, so the name now exists
        - label Cheapest fix
          desc Leaves the cycle in place: import the module, not the name
    - label from a import helper
      children
        - label Demands the attribute now
          desc Fetches helper mid-execution, while a is still initializing
        - label a is half-initialized
          desc Only names bound above its own import line exist yet
        - label Raises ImportError
          desc cannot import name from partially initialized module
        - label Forces a real fix
          desc Restructure to a shared module, or use a late import
theme
  palette #10b981 #f43f5e
